  "legacy": {
    "label": "facets of the goldens recorded by EXECUTING the unmodified legacy cl.bcs.plataforma.report.api.ReportDocument (+ BcsUtils ListMapResultSet), Crystal JRC 14.1, JDK 11, headless, H2 stand-in for HANA, fake rows",
